# phoenixctl

Phoenix CLI for telemetry launch, tail, triage, and Tier 0 gates.

**Documentation:** [`Xenia-Phoenix/metacache/dev/55_cursor_live_probe.md`](../../../metacache/dev/55_cursor_live_probe.md) and [`56_phoenixctl_reference.md`](../../../metacache/dev/56_phoenixctl_reference.md).

```powershell
cd xenia-phoenix-src
pip install -e tools/phoenixctl
phoenixctl preflight
```
